            "en": "below",
            "ref": "29:55",
            "verse": "يَوْمَ يَغْشَىٰهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ مِن فَوْقِهِمْ وَمِن تَحْتِ أَرْجُلِهِمْ وَيَقُولُ ذُوقُوا۟ مَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ",
            "verseEn": "On the Day the punishment will cover them from above them and from below their feet and it is said, \"Taste [the result of] what you used to do.\""
          },
          {
