          {
            "ar": "فَرَجَعُوا",
            "en": "So they returned",
            "ref": "21:64",
            "verse": "فَرَجَعُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ فَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّكُمْ أَنتُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ",
            "verseEn": "So they returned to [blaming] themselves and said [to each other], \"Indeed, you are the wrongdoers.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "وَأَنجَيْنَا",
            "en": "And We saved",
            "ref": "26:65",
