            "en": "a slave",
            "ref": "43:59",
            "verse": "إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا عَبْدٌ أَنْعَمْنَا عَلَيْهِ وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ مَثَلًۭا لِّبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ",
            "verseEn": "He [i.e., Jesus] was not but a servant upon whom We bestowed favor, and We made him an example for the Children of Israel."
